                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "A warm neighborhood bar with a refined and quiet atmosphere — the perfect little spot to unwind. The wine selection includes carefully chosen red and white wines from various regions, including bottles directly from wineries. The owner thoughtfully introduces different varieties or simply chats with guests. You’ll also find a curated selection of beers, Japanese whisky, and even peated options, making it easy for everyone to discover their own favorite drink.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
